# Newsletter

The newsletter has one process, and it lives in `.claude/skills/newsletter/SKILL.md`. Read that file and follow it exactly for any newsletter work: starting, editing, reviewing, sending, or correcting an issue. Don't keep a second copy of the process here, so the two can't drift.

Short version of the rules that never bend:

- Read the state first: `npm run newsletter status`.
- Send only on the owner's word in that session.
- One newsletter per calendar month. Only an emergency correction is exempt.
- Issue files hold plain text only. The look lives in `src/lib/newsletter/render.ts`.
